:"관계를","x":1408,"y":1754,"width":74,"height":30}]},{"text":"가지고 있는 다른 여러 가지의 데이터들 또한 복잡한 형태의 관계들이 불가피해져 복잡성을 증가시켜 왔다. 결국","words":[{"text":"가지고","x":198,"y":1802,"width":78,"height":31},{"text":"있는","x":287,"y":1803,"width":51,"height":31},{"text":"다른","x":348,"y":1803,"width":50,"height":30},{"text":"여러","x":408,"y":1803,"width":48,"height":30},{"text":"가지의","x":469,"y":1801,"width":72,"height":32},{"text":"데이터들","x":554,"y":1801,"width":98,"height":31},{"text":"또한","x":661,"y":1803,"width":51,"height":30},{"text":"복잡한","x":722,"y":1803,"width":74,"height":31},{"text":"형태의","x":806,"y":1801,"width":72,"height":32},{"text":"관계들이","x":890,"y":1801,"width":98,"height":31},{"text":"불가피해져","x":1001,"y":1801,"width":123,"height":31},{"text":"복잡성을","x":1136,"y":1801,"width":102,"height":31},{"text":"증가시켜","x":1248,"y":1802,"width":98,"height":32},{"text":"왔다.","x":1359,"y":1802,"width":58,"height":30},{"text":"결국","x":1432,"y":1802,"width":50,"height":31}]},{"text":"간결한 모텔의 기본적인 전제는 통합이다. 합리적으로 잘 정돈된 방법으로 데이터를 통합하여 데이터의 집합을","words":[{"text":"간결한","x":197,"y":1851,"width":79,"height":29},{"text":"모텔의","x":287,"y":1851,"width":75,"height":30},{"text":"기본적인","x":377,"y":1851,"width":98,"height":31},{"text":"전제는","x":489,"y":1850,"width":74,"height":30},{"text":"통합이다.","x":573,"y":1850,"width":105,"height":30},{"text":"합리적으로","x":692,"y":1851,"width":124,"height":30},{"text":"잘","x":828,"y":1850,"width":25,"height":30},{"text":"정돈된","x":866,"y":1850,"width":71,"height":30},{"text":"방법으로","x":952,"y":1850,"width":101,"height":30},{"text":"데이터를","x":1066,"y":1850,"width":98,"height":30},{"text":"통합하여","x":1177,"y":1851,"width":98,"height":30},{"text":"데이터의","x":1291,"y":1850,"width":97,"height":30},{"text":"집합을","x":1405,"y":1850,"width":76,"height":30}]},{"text":"정의하괵 이를 데이터 모델로 잘 표현•활용한다면 원만한 업무 변화에도 데이터 모텔이 영향을 받지 않고 온용할","words":[{"text":"정의하괵","x":197,"y":1898,"width":109,"height":35},{"text":"이를","x":320,"y":1898,"width":49,"height":31},{"text":"데이터","x":379,"y":1899,"wi